{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_114_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，王二月，丁丑，公薨於臺下。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"臺下，非正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"二、秦伯罃卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"三、夏，五月，戊戌，齊人弒其君商人。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"四、六月，癸酉，葬我君文公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"五、秋，公子遂、叔孫得臣如齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"使舉上客，而不稱介，不正其同倫而相介，故列而數之也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月，子卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"子卒，不日，故也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"七、夫人姜氏歸於齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"惡宣公也。有不待貶絕，而罪惡見者；有待貶絕，而惡從之者。姪娣者，不孤子之意也。一人有子，三人緩帶。一曰就賢也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"八、季孫行父如齊。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_114_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_114","textTraditional":"九、莒弒其君庶其。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}